{"task_id": "Mbpp/3", "solution": "def is_not_prime(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a given integer is a non-prime number.\"\"\"\n    if number <= 1:\n        return True\n    if number == 2:\n        return False\n    if number % 2 == 0:\n        return True\n    \n    i = 3\n    while i * i <= number:\n        if number % i == 0:\n            return True\n        i += 2\n    return False"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/7", "solution": "def find_char_long(input_string: str) -> set[str]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Identifies words in the input_string that are at least 4 characters long.\n    Words are delimited by spaces.\n    \"\"\"\n    long_words = set()\n    words = input_string.split()\n    for word in words:\n        if len(word) >= 4:\n            long_words.add(word)\n    return long_words"}
