{"task_id": "Mbpp/20", "solution": "def is_woodall(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the given number is a Woodall number.\n    A Woodall number is defined as W_n = n * 2^n - 1 for a non-negative integer n.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = 0\n    while True:\n        woodall_candidate = n * (2**n) - 1\n        if woodall_candidate == number:\n            return True\n        if woodall_candidate > number:\n            return False\n        n += 1"}
