{"task_id": "Mbpp/68", "solution": "def is_Monotonic(array: list) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the given array is monotonic (either monotonically increasing or decreasing).\n    An array is monotonic if all its elements are in non-decreasing or non-increasing order.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(array)\n    if n <= 1:\n        return True\n\n    is_increasing = True\n    is_decreasing = True\n\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        if array[i] < array[i-1]:\n            is_increasing = False\n        if array[i] > array[i-1]:\n            is_decreasing = False\n\n        # If it's neither increasing nor decreasing, we can stop early\n        if not is_increasing and not is_decreasing:\n            return False\n\n    return is_increasing or is_decreasing"}
