{"task_id": "Mbpp/162", "solution": "def sum_series(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the series (n - 2*i) for i from 0 up to n // 2,\n    including only non-negative terms.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(n // 2 + 1):\n        current_term = n - (2 * i)\n        if current_term >= 0:\n            total_sum += current_term\n    return total_sum"}
