{"task_id": "Mbpp/409", "solution": "def min_product_tuple(input_list: list[tuple[int | float, int | float]]) -> int | float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the minimum product from pairs of numerical elements within a given list of tuples.\n    Returns float('inf') if the input list is empty.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_list:\n        return float('inf')\n\n    min_prod = float('inf')\n    for item1, item2 in input_list:\n        current_product = item1 * item2\n        if current_product < min_prod:\n            min_prod = current_product\n    return min_prod"}
