{"task_id": "Mbpp/567", "solution": "def issort_list(list_to_check: list) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the specified list is sorted in ascending order.\n    An empty list or a list with a single element is considered sorted.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(list_to_check) <= 1:\n        return True\n\n    for i in range(1, len(list_to_check)):\n        if list_to_check[i] < list_to_check[i-1]:\n            return False\n    return True"}
