{"task_id": "Mbpp/638", "solution": "import math\n\ndef wind_chill(wind_velocity_kmh: float, temperature_celsius: float) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the wind chill index rounded to the next integer using the standard formula.\n    The formula used is WCI = 13.12 + 0.6215*T - 11.37*V^0.16 + 0.3965*T*V^0.16.\n    \"\"\"\n    T = temperature_celsius\n    V = wind_velocity_kmh\n    \n    # Wind Chill Index formula for Celsius and km/h\n    wci = 13.12 + 0.6215 * T - 11.37 * (V**0.16) + 0.3965 * T * (V**0.16)\n    \n    # Round to the next integer (ceiling function)\n    return math.ceil(wci)"}
