{"task_id": "Mbpp/644", "solution": "def reverse_Array_Upto_K(arr: list, k: int) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Reverses the order of elements in an array from its beginning up to a specified 1-based position K.\n    Elements beyond K remain in their original order.\n    \"\"\"\n    left = 0\n    right = k - 1\n\n    while left < right:\n        arr[left], arr[right] = arr[right], arr[left]\n        left += 1\n        right -= 1\n    return arr"}
