{"task_id": "Mbpp/784", "solution": "def mul_even_odd(numbers: list[int]) -> int | None:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the product of the first even and first odd number in the given list.\n    Returns None if either an even or odd number is not found.\n    \"\"\"\n    first_odd = None\n    first_even = None\n\n    for number in numbers:\n        if first_odd is None and number % 2 != 0:\n            first_odd = number\n        if first_even is None and number % 2 == 0:\n            first_even = number\n        \n        if first_odd is not None and first_even is not None:\n            break\n            \n    if first_odd is not None and first_even is not None:\n        return first_odd * first_even\n    else:\n        return None"}
